            "notes": "Round one is easy, just play Reaper. I used to use [Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c) here, but I've found that the lifesteal is less valuable in round one.  [Spirited to Slay](item_e11c7adb-70b7-4816-8e31-2c94c600bfd5) is far more valuable in round one. Get in and get out.\n\n [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) is a solid choice but can be swapped out. I find that armor with Reaper is really valuable when flanking. As a squishy, a Reaper with armor is just that much worse.",
