            "notes": "For round three you'll pick [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51). This is because shooting faster offers more lifesteal than just lifesteal bonuses. More instances of lifesteal offers more survivability than a lot of lifesteal at lower fire-rate.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)  is just good for lifesteal builds. You'll be building overhealth that doesnt decay when you flank an enemy. With weapon focused builds, Death Blossom is useless. You will simply just die. I've noticed that Phantasmic Flux negates some of that uselessness. However, you'll want to avoid using death blossom in later rounds. \n\n[Nightcreeper](item_d13ac4bd-e7be-4c95-9715-08a475fb3486) is helpful when Shadow Stepping so you can plan your attack when you reveal your enemies.",
